      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "As nice as it looks, I don't think that they would add it, considering that's even more work for their servers to do. The IK is pretty bad as it is, performance-wise. And the lack of letting us use more performance friendly options, well. Yeah. I can't see this coming unless they can get the stick out of their behinds and the cotton out of their ears. (or maybe it's a chip on their shoulder, who knows? They certainly haven't been very transparent)\n\nThere's many fixes that users have suggested, but they keep refusing to use the fixes, and performance has been just dropping so much. They're just disabling things left and right instead of actually fixing the underlying issues. (Or simply being a human and publicly admitting their own limitations as programmers)",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
